#. type: Content of: <para>
#: blfs-en/xincludes/SIOCGSTAMP.xml:7
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>sed -i ... SIOCGSTAMP ...</parameter>: In linux-5.2 the "
"definitions of SIOCGSTAMP and SIOCGSTAMPNS were moved from "
"&lt;sys/socket.h&gt; which packages have traditionally included to get them."
" The sed(s) to hard-code the values enable the package to compile correctly."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>sed -i ... SIOCGSTAMP ...</parameter>: No linux-5.2 as definições"
" de SIOCGSTAMP e SIOCGSTAMPNS foram movidas de &lt;sys/socket.h&gt; o qual "
"pacotes tradicionalmente incluíam para obtê-las. O(s) sed(s) para "
"rigidamente codificar os valores habilitam o pacote para compilar "
"corretamente."
